  "description": "\"I r-really l-love you. My princess, you're so pretty.\"\n\nI was confessed to by Chu Ji-hoon, a guy who only ever talked about food. Never mind the fact that his stuttering makes it hard to understand him, who on earth confesses so out of the blue? I clearly rejected him and said I was sorry, but... With a height close to 190 cm, a massive build, muscles, and even other parts of him that have absolutely nothing cute about them... I don't know why he keeps looking so cute to me.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002668)",
